---
import Figure from '../Figure.astro';
---
<Figure id="d-proto-node-layers">
<svg viewBox="0 0 760 520" role="img" aria-label="The layers of one node: HTTP on one listener; outer layers in the clear (CORS, app frontends, the consent page, attestation and health); the sealed envelope; the API router judging every request on fresh system state; the Node, which routes to leaders and proposes; the system group and the app groups with the component engine; calimero-log's Raft groups; and one RocksDB store sealed under the cluster key. Beside them: the KMS client, TDX quotes, identity and peers." xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
  <rect x="0" y="0" width="760" height="520" rx="10" fill="#0f0f16"/>
  <text x="290" y="24" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="11" font-weight="700">one node: merod → calimero-node</text>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:0">
    <rect x="20" y="38" width="540" height="44" rx="8" fill="#161b22" stroke="#444c56" stroke-dasharray="5 4"/>
    <text x="290" y="56" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">HTTP on one listener (--listen)</text>
    <text x="290" y="72" text-anchor="middle" fill="#8b949e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">clients, browsers, peers and mdma; TLS, if any, ends outside the TD</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:1">
    <rect x="20" y="90" width="540" height="44" rx="8" fill="#231708" stroke="#f0883e" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="290" y="108" text-anchor="middle" fill="#f0883e" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">outer layers, in the clear</text>
    <text x="290" y="124" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">CORS · app frontends &#123;label&#125;.apps-domain · consent page · /attestation · /health</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:2">
    <rect x="20" y="142" width="540" height="44" rx="8" fill="#13160f" stroke="#a5ff11" stroke-width="1.6"/>
    <text x="290" y="160" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a5ff11" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">sealed envelope (calimero-sealed)</text>
    <text x="290" y="176" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">Noise NK (clients) / IK (peers) · opens the inner request · seals response frames</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:3">
    <rect x="20" y="194" width="540" height="44" rx="8" fill="#161b22" stroke="#58a6ff" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="290" y="212" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">API router (api.rs, api/&lt;area&gt;.rs)</text>
    <text x="290" y="228" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">credential and access judged on fresh system state · /auth /apps /orgs /ops /internal</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:4">
    <rect x="20" y="246" width="540" height="44" rx="8" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="290" y="264" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">Node (node.rs, node/*)</text>
    <text x="290" y="280" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">route to leaders · propose · reconcile · receipts · blobs and files · compute runs</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:5">
    <rect x="20" y="298" width="200" height="72" rx="8" fill="#1a1430" stroke="#a371f7" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="120" y="318" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a371f7" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">system group (1)</text>
    <text x="120" y="336" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">SystemMachine, in memory</text>
    <text x="120" y="350" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">accounts, orgs, directory,</text>
    <text x="120" y="363" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">packages, fleet</text>
    <rect x="232" y="298" width="328" height="72" rx="8" fill="#1a1430" stroke="#a371f7" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="396" y="318" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a371f7" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">app groups (one per instance)</text>
    <text x="396" y="336" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">AppMachine: Head in memory, rows on disk</text>
    <text x="396" y="350" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">leader runs: calimero-app-host</text>
    <text x="396" y="363" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">on calimero-app-engine-wasmtime</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:6">
    <rect x="20" y="378" width="540" height="44" rx="8" fill="#16222e" stroke="#39d0d8" stroke-width="1.4"/>
    <text x="290" y="396" text-anchor="middle" fill="#39d0d8" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">calimero-log: one openraft Engine, one Group per log</text>
    <text x="290" y="412" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">propose · append · commit · apply in order · snapshots · Raft RPCs over internal/raft</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:7">
    <rect x="20" y="430" width="540" height="72" rx="8" fill="#161b22" stroke="#39d0d8" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <text x="290" y="450" text-anchor="middle" fill="#39d0d8" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="10" font-weight="700">&lt;data-dir&gt;: one RocksDB store, sealed under K_c</text>
    <text x="290" y="468" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">columns log · meta · state · blobs; snapshots/ · components/</text>
    <text x="290" y="482" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8.5">cluster-key and signing-key, wrapped under K_r</text>
    <text x="290" y="496" text-anchor="middle" fill="#6b6b80" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">--backup-dir and --recovery-dir sit beside it</text>
  </g>

  <g class="seq-step" style="--step-i:8">
    <rect x="580" y="90" width="162" height="70" rx="8" fill="#13160f" stroke="#a5ff11" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <text x="661" y="110" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a5ff11" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">calimero-kms-client</text>
    <text x="661" y="127" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">K_r from mero-kms,</text>
    <text x="661" y="140" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">rollback counter</text>
    <rect x="580" y="170" width="162" height="70" rx="8" fill="#10210f" stroke="#3fb950" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <text x="661" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="#3fb950" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">tee-attestation</text>
    <text x="661" y="207" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">TDX quotes over</text>
    <text x="661" y="220" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">transport/receipt keys</text>
    <rect x="580" y="250" width="162" height="70" rx="8" fill="#161b22" stroke="#58a6ff" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <text x="661" y="270" text-anchor="middle" fill="#58a6ff" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">calimero-identity</text>
    <text x="661" y="287" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">passkeys, sessions,</text>
    <text x="661" y="300" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">API keys, consents</text>
    <rect x="580" y="330" width="162" height="92" rx="8" fill="#1a1430" stroke="#a371f7" stroke-width="1.2"/>
    <text x="661" y="350" text-anchor="middle" fill="#a371f7" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="9" font-weight="700">peers</text>
    <text x="661" y="367" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">internal/* over an</text>
    <text x="661" y="380" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">identified sealed</text>
    <text x="661" y="393" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">channel to each</text>
    <text x="661" y="406" text-anchor="middle" fill="#c9d1d9" font-family="'JetBrains Mono', monospace" font-size="8">attested peer</text>
  </g>
</svg>
</Figure>
